# Cloudflare Pages / Workers static assets headers. OWNER: platform agent.
# Cross-origin isolation enables SharedArrayBuffer → multithreaded ONNX Runtime WASM (spec §16).
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
  Cross-Origin-Resource-Policy: same-origin
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
